cks: the coding agent\u0027s API with its review app on port 5082, and louis-agent.dev and this site on ports 5080 and 5084. \u0022Watch every turn\u0022 starts the Aspire dashboard, which shows each turn\u0027s traces and logs. \u0022Shipped on every merge\u0022 explains that a merge to \u0060main\u0060 releases both sites to Azure.\n\n\u0060src/docs/projects/LouisAgent.Web.Framework.md\u0060\n\nOffer({\n  question: \u0022Which part do you want to look at first?\u0022,\n  choices: [\n    { label: \u0022Run it on my machine\u0022, why: \u0022The two Docker stacks and their start commands.\u0022, suggested: true },\n    { label: \u0022Watch a turn\u0022, why: \u0022The Aspire dashboard and what it records.\u0022 },\n    { label: \u0022How it ships to Azure\u0022, why: \u0022The merge workflow and the Container Apps.\u0022 }\n  ]\n})"}],"messageId":"msg_011ChSABix7L2KeZ7iqRxTLH"}],"responseId":"msg_011ChSABix7L2KeZ7iqRxTLH","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","createdAt":"2026-11-26T20:19:39.0457161\u002B00:00","finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokenCount":10454,"outputTokenCount":863,"totalTokenCount":11317,"cachedInputTokenCount":9553,"additionalCounts":{"CacheCreationInputTokens":897}}}